# Why was a village funeral a scandal? Courbet's A Burial at Ornans
tags: ["art history","realism","courbet","painting scandals","19th century france","social class in art"]
thumb: "band \"Why was this a scandal?\" picture \"File:Gustave_Courbet_-_A_Burial_at_Ornans_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg\" colour"
